hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18048","Muhammad ibn Abi Adi narrated to us from Ibn Awn from Abu Ramlah, he said: Mikhnaf ibn Sulaym narrated to us, he said: While we were with the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) and he was standing at Arafat, then he said: O people, upon every household, or upon every household in every year is a sacrifice and an atirah. He said: Do you know what the atirah is. Ibn Awn said: Then I do not know what they answered. He said: This which the people call rajabiyyah."
